<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container"><a href="/admin/results/<%= result.id %>" class="hero-back">← Back to result</a><div class="eyebrow">PILOT RESULT — NOT FOR OFFICIAL USE</div><h1>GEST Pilot Diagnostic Report</h1><p><%= result.first_name %> <%= result.family_name %> · <%= result.candidate_number %> · <%= result.centre_code %> · <%= result.test_date %></p></div></section>
<section class="container section content-wide"><div class="alert alert-warning"><strong>NOT AN OFFICIAL CERTIFICATE.</strong> GEST Pilot Scoring <%= snap.version %> is provisional and not psychometrically validated for CEFR claims. Not suitable for university admission, employment or immigration.</div>
<div class="panel"><h2>Diagnostic skill scores</h2><div class="score-preview"><% ['listening','reading','writing','speaking'].forEach(k=>{ %><div><small><%= k %></small><strong><%= result[k] %>/100</strong></div><% }) %></div><h3>Overall: <%= result.overall %>/100 · Provisional CEFR band: <%= result.cefr %></h3><p>Reading: <%= snap.reading.correct %>/40 correct · Listening: <%= snap.listening.correct %>/35 correct</p><p>Writing: <%= snap.writing.markers.length %> independent marks; third required: <%= snap.writing.third_required?'yes':'no' %>.</p><p>Speaking based on four examiner rubric criteria.</p><p>Form: <%= snap.form_code %> · Version: <%= snap.version %> · Status: <%= result.status %></p><p>Provisional conversion only. Interpret with professional advice; the instrument has not established internationally accepted CEFR standard-setting evidence.</p><p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/admin/pilot/results/<%= result.id %>/pdf">Download Pilot Result PDF</a></p></div></section>
